hunk 2048`, full 262,144 ctx with 2 lanes (23.4/24.5 GiB used). Env overrides: `NINFER_HOST`, `NINFER_PORT`, `NINFER_MODEL`, `NINFER_SERVER`, `NINFER_CHAT_TEMPLATE`, `NINFER_CONTEXT`, `NINFER_CONCURRENCY`, `NINFER_KV_CAPACITY`, `NINFER_KV_DTYPE`, `NINFER_SPEC`, `NINFER_DRAFT_TOKENS`, `NINFER_PREFILL_CHUNK`, `NINFER_VISION`, `NINFER_HOST_STATE_SLOTS`, `NINFER_MIN_P`, `NINFER_PRESENCE_PENALTY`, `NINFER_FALLBACK=off`. Startup step-down: context shrinks 1/8 per rung up to 5× if VRAM-refused.\nDirect server binary: `./ninfer-serve models/qwen3_8_27b.ninfer --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8080 --max-context <T> --kv-capacity <T> --max-concurrency N --kv-dtype rk4v4|int8 --device-state-slots N --host-state-slots N --spec mtp|dflash|dflash2 --draft-tokens K --lm-head-draft [--prefill-cublas] [--prefill-chunk N] [--vision --vision-residency overlay] [--decode-rounds-per-prefill N]`.\nFrom-source build (Linux): CUDA 12.8+, CMake ≥3.28, GCC 13, Ninja:\n```\ncmake -S . -B build-sm86 -G Ninja -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release -DCMAKE_C_COMPILER=gcc-13 -DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=g++-13 -DCMAKE_CUDA_COMPILER=nvcc -DCMAKE_CUDA_HOST_COMPILER=g++-13 -DCMAKE_CUDA_ARCHITECTURES=86 -DNINFER_BUILD_APPS=ON -DBUILD_TESTING=OFF\ncmake --build build-sm86 --parallel 2\n# or: ./scripts/build.sh --test --package\n```\nWARNING (in docs): never set `CMAKE_CUDA_ARCHITECTURES=89`; keep `86`. Docker path: `docker build --tag ninfer-3090:sm86 .` (Ubuntu 24.04, CUDA 13.1).\nKEY FLAGS: max-context = `--max-context` (per-request cap) + `--kv-capacity` (pool; launchers set both to profile context); concurrency = `--max-concurrency` (C1..C8); spec-decode = `--spec mtp --draft-tokens 3` (MTP3) or `--spec dflash2 --draft-tokens 7 --lm-head-draft` (DFlash2; DFlash2 on the new artifact REQUIRES `--lm-head-draft` or startup fails); KV quant = `--kv-dtype bf16|int8|rk4v4|rk8v4|fp8|nvfp4|k8v4` (nvfp4/k8v4 are Blackwell-only, refused on sm_86); `--host-state-slots 32` pins 2.34 GiB host RAM (StateImage 74.5 MiB/slot with `--gdn-state