tx. Fallback = int8_per_token_head Triton route (+2.5% e2e at chat length, -34% decode at 60k).\n- **OOM boundary (qubex22 ladder, 24 GB)**: GPU_UTIL 0.96 → OOM in GDN `chunk_o.py` on first request; 0.97 → OOM during warmup; 0.95 boots but profiled budget swings ~1 GiB boot-to-boot (\"profiler lottery\", restart self-heals); upstream vllm PR #55149 / issue #50780 track the FLA workspace accounting. Durable fix = `--kv-cache-memory` byte pin. MAX_SEQS>12 at CTX=huge → engine dies on first prompt (396 MiB free = dead, 436 = fine). KV_MEM above default: +150 MiB ran, +200 MiB killed.\n- **vLLM 0.28.0 engine-stall bug #107** (stops stepping 20 s–2.3 h, self-recovers, nothing logged) — reason 0.29.0 port exists; 0.29/0.30 not affected per docs.\n- KVarN+MTP+prefix caching corrupts prompt_logprobs (#64, gotcha 51) — generation fine; PIECEWISE graphs + prefix-cache hit corrupted outputs at specific prompt residues (fixed at HEAD, all 128 residues swept under FULL).\n- Greedy is not deterministic across drafter configs (±3% acceptance noise); int8-activation path served garbage for an hour of beautiful numbers before PPL caught it — always run quality_battery.\n- FlashInfer JIT needs nvcc version EQUAL to CUDA headers (13.0.x pins in install.md); flashinfer-cubin 0.6.18 is ~6.3 GB unpacked; curand headers needed on venv path or silent fallback.\n- GHCR `pull_policy: missing` trap on branch builds (quietly runs main's image instead of your tree).\n- NOT-FOUND items: none — both repos exist. No GitHub releases/tags (commit+image pinning only); `-fast` variant's exact HF repo id unverified (401 anon; it's materialized locally by `prepare/fetch_fast_variant.py`).\n\n**Fit for the campaign**: strongest documented 3090 candidate for Qwen3.8-27B — GPU-resident, no CPU offload, OpenAI-native, and it publishes a reproducible tok/s+TTFT protocol (`bench/run_benchmarks.sh`) plus an independent second protocol (qubex22). Bonsai-2-27B is NOT covered (Qwen-specific kernels gated on `num_heads==24/num_kv_heads==4/head_size==256`; other models fall back to FA2 correctness without the prefill win). Context tiers: 64k trivial, 150–184k fp8, 262k requires KVarN install or int4_per_token_head mode."
