github.com/0xSero/qwen38-3090-sglang.git && cd qwen38-3090-sglang && docker build -t qwen38-3090 . then same docker run.\nEntry-point logic (entrypoint.sh, verbatim flags):\n- Pin/pull: hf download cyankiwi/Qwen3.8-27B-AWQ-INT4 --revision 63768c10df38c0395e12ef49edac1bd539eaeeea --local-dir $MODELS_DIR/Qwen3.8-27B-AWQ-INT4 ; draft: RadixArk/Qwen3.8-27B-DSpark --revision 85ef153be924f17ce4bf62726954eeaa4a73e854.\n- Serve: python3 -m sglang.launch_server --model-path $MODELS/Qwen3.8-27B-AWQ-INT4 --tp $TP --chunked-prefill-size 4096 --mamba-radix-cache-strategy extra_buffer --host 0.0.0.0 --port $PORT plus preset flags by TP:DSpark case:\n  · 1:1 → --mem-fraction-static 0.92 --max-mamba-cache-size 4 --disable-prefill-cuda-graph --cuda-graph-max-bs 4\n  · 1:0 → --mem-fraction-static 0.92 --max-mamba-cache-size 8 --disable-prefill-cuda-graph --cuda-graph-max-bs 8   (DSPARK auto-forced to 0 on TP=1)\n  · 2:1 → --mem-fraction-static 0.85 --max-mamba-cache-size 16 --disable-prefill-cuda-graph --cuda-graph-max-bs 16\n  · 2:0 → --mem-fraction-static 0.85 --max-mamba-cache-size 32 --disable-prefill-cuda-graph --cuda-graph-max-bs 16\n  · 4:1 → --mem-fraction-static 0.72 ; 4:0 → --mem-fraction-static 0.80\n- Spec-decode flags when DSPARK=1: --speculative-algorithm DSPARK --speculative-draft-model-path $DRAFT --speculative-dspark-block-size 7 --speculative-draft-model-quantization unquant\n- Context length: no --context-length flag is set; effective max context = KV pool: TP1 ≈8k (14,775-token KV pool), TP2 64k (118,693-token pool; 128k prompts truncate), TP4 128k (275,018-token pool). DSpark is NOT viable on 1×3090 (auto-disabled; ~21.7 GB draft+target leaves <1 GB KV). Concurrency: GDN mamba state pool bounds it, not KV — max-running-requests equivalents: TP1=8, TP2=48, TP4=9.\n\n3) ARTIFACTS\n- Target: cyankiwi/Qwen3.8-27B-AWQ-INT4 (HF, apache-2.0, compressed-tensors/AWQ W4A16 INT4 + Marlin kernels, qwen3_5 arch tag). Repo total 21 GB: model-00001..00005-of-00005.safetensors =